---
import ProjectLayout from "../layouts/project-layout.astro"
import Button1 from "../components/button1.astro"
import Image from "../components/image.astro"

import notesRoom from "../assets/projects/page-images/notesRoom.png"
import matchBox from "../assets/projects/page-images/MatchBox.png"


---

<ProjectLayout name="notes escape room" colour="#7c1717">

    <p>Notes Escape Room is a passion project I have started and is currently in progress. 
        It will combine all areas of my interest to create an interactible point-and-click game
        reminescent of old flash games I played in my childhood. I'm combining 3D design, C# development,
        sound design, and vast levels of problem solving skills to create a system that makes developing these games easy.
        by implementing custom classes and objects within Godot to streamline each process, Notes Escape Room will be the
        first room designed using my processes.
    </p>
    <Image src={notesRoom.src} colour="#7c1717" class="notesRoom"></Image>
    <p>
        This project is being developed inside of Godot using C# and is putting my abilities to plan coherently
        and effectively to the test. It's allowing me to utilize a lot of the theoretical knowledge I have
        gained about computer science by allowing me to create efficient abstract data types and algorithms.
        In the end I'll end up with an engaging and fun way to demonstrate my abilities in several areas at once.
    </p>
    <Image src={matchBox.src} colour="#7c1717" class="matchBox"></Image>
    <p>
        Once the project is completed it will be exported to its own GitHub page in a way that will allow it to
        be embedded into other projects and played in whatever site I choose to place it inside of. To see the current
        progress and recent update on the GitHub repo, click below.
    </p>

    <div class="btn">
        <Button1 href="https://github.com/AndrewKehler/NotesEscapeRoom">See Project</Button1>
    </div>
</ProjectLayout>
<style>
	@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Graduate&family=Intel+One+Mono:ital,wght@0,300..700;1,300..700&display=swap');

	.graduate-regular {
		font-family: "Graduate", serif;
		font-weight: 400;
		font-style: normal;
	}
	body{
		margin: 0;
		overflow-x: hidden;
		
	}

</style>
<style>
    .btn{
        display: flex;
        align-self: center;
        justify-self: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100%;
        font-size: clamp(.5em, 0.8vw, 2em);
    }

    .notesRoom{
        position: relative;
        width: 25%;
        justify-self: flex-end;
        margin: -5% -5% 0 0;
        transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
    .notesRoom :global(img){
        width: 105%;
        margin-bottom: -7%;
        padding-top: 7%;
    }

    .matchBox{
        position: relative;
        width: 25%;
        justify-self: flex-start;
        margin: -2% 0 0 0;
        /* transform: scaleX(-1); */
    }
</style>